  "review": "<h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 border-b-2 border-amber-500 pb-2 mb-4\">【2026】新幹線トクだ値・EX早特×温泉宿！最安値で秋の連休を旅する新幹線パック＆駅近名旅館比較！越後湯沢・上諏訪</h2>\n\n<div class=\"my-6 p-6 bg-gradient-to-br from-sky-50 via-amber-50/40 to-stone-50 border border-sky-200 rounded-3xl shadow-sm space-y-3\">\n  <h3 class=\"text-base font-bold text-sky-950 flex items-center gap-2\">🚅 新幹線早割（えきねっとトクだ値・EX早特）を活用する最安予約術</h3>\n  <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed\">JR東日本の「えきねっとトクだ値」やJR東海道・山陽新幹線の「EX早特」を活用すれば、新幹線代が最大30〜50%割引に。駅から徒歩3分または無料送迎付きの宿を選べば、レンタカー代も浮いて圧倒的にお得な秋旅が完成します。</p>\n</div>\n\n<h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-stone-900 border-b border-amber-300 pb-2 my-6 flex items-center gap-2\">🏆 新幹線駅から直行できる厳選名宿</h2>\n\n<div class=\"my-8 p-6 rounded-3xl bg-white border border-amber-200/90 shadow-md hover:shadow-lg transition duration-300\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-amber-100 pb-3 mb-4\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-amber-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-lg\">第1位</span>\n      <h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-stone-900\">越後湯沢温泉　湯沢グランドホテル＜新潟県＞</h3>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"px-2.5 py-0.5 bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 font-extrabold text-xs rounded-full\">⭐ 4.55</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"mb-4\"><img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/38764/38764.jpg\" alt=\"越後湯沢温泉　湯沢グランドホテル＜新潟県＞ 外観・客室\" class=\"w-full h-56 object-cover rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-sm\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div>\n  <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-amber-950 bg-amber-50 p-2.5 rounded-xl mb-3 border border-amber-100\">✨ 【上越新幹線 越後湯沢駅東口徒歩3分】四季の庭園露天風呂と新潟の地酒バー＆魚沼コシヒカリ</p>\n  <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed my-2\">東京駅から最速70分。駅改札を出て徒歩3分の圧倒的アクセス。四季折々の庭園露天風呂や地酒バーラウンジ、炊きたて魚沼コシヒカリ会席が絶品。</p>\n  \n  <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-2.5 my-3 text-xs\">\n    <div class=\"p-3 bg-stone-50 rounded-xl border border-stone-200\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">👤 こんな旅におすすめ：</strong>新幹線旅行派、ご夫婦、シニア、駅近で名湯と地酒を満喫したい人</div>\n    <div class=\"p-3 bg-emerald-50/60 rounded-xl border border-emerald-200\"><strong class=\"text-emerald-950\">🎯 選ぶ決め手：</strong>新幹線駅徒歩3分の最強立地と極上魚沼会席なら迷わずここ！</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"pt-3 text-center\">\n    <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Fhb.afl.rakuten.co.jp%2Fhgc%2F54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583%2F%3Fpc%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fimg.travel.rakuten.co.jp%252Fimage%252Ftr%252Fapi%252Fkw%252FJBe8h%252F%253Ff_no%253D38764\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block w-full md:w-auto px-8 py-3.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 via-amber-600 to-orange-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-2xl shadow-md hover:scale-105 transition transform\">\n      ✈️ 【公式楽天トラベル】越後湯沢温泉　湯沢グランドホテル＜新潟県＞ の最新空室・最安値プランを見る\n    </a>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"my-8 p-6 rounded-3xl bg-white border border-amber-200/90 shadow-md hover:shadow-lg transition duration-300\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-amber-100 pb-3 mb-4\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-amber-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-lg\">第2位</span>\n      <h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-stone-900\">信州上諏訪温泉　諏訪別邸　朱白（旧　双泉の宿　朱白）</h3>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"px-2.5 py-0.5 bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 font-extrabold text-xs rounded-full\">⭐ 4.43</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"mb-4\"><img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/52948/52948.jpg\" alt=\"信州上諏訪温泉　諏訪別邸　朱白（旧　双泉の宿　朱白） 外観・客室\" class=\"w-full h-56 object-cover rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-sm\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div>\n  <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-amber-950 bg-amber-50 p-2.5 rounded-xl mb-3 border border-amber-100\">✨ 【特急あずさ 上諏訪駅徒歩8分（送迎あり）】諏訪湖一望の二色の自家源泉＆諏訪五蔵地酒</p>\n  <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed my-2\">新宿駅から特急あずさで直行。諏訪湖畔に佇み、茶褐色と透明の2つの自家源泉を完備。諏訪五蔵の銘酒利き酒と信州プレミアム牛会席が人気。</p>\n  \n  <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-2.5 my-3 text-xs\">\n    <div class=\"p-3 bg-stone-50 rounded-xl border border-stone-200\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">👤 こんな旅におすすめ：</strong>カップル、ご夫婦、電車で信州の美景と美酒を楽しみたい人</div>\n    <div class=\"p-3 bg-emerald-50/60 rounded-xl border border-emerald-200\"><strong class=\"text-emerald-950\">🎯 選ぶ決め手：</strong>諏訪湖パノラマ露天風呂と諏訪五蔵の地酒ならここ！</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"pt-3 text-center\">\n    <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Fhb.afl.rakuten.co.jp%2Fhgc%2F54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583%2F%3Fpc%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fimg.travel.rakuten.co.jp%252Fimage%252Ftr%252Fapi%252Fkw%252FJBe8h%252F%253Ff_no%253D52948\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block w-full md:w-auto px-8 py-3.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 via-amber-600 to-orange-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-2xl shadow-md hover:scale-105 transition transform\">\n      ✈️ 【公式楽天トラベル】信州上諏訪温泉　諏訪別邸　朱白（旧　双泉の宿　朱白） の最新空室・最安値プランを見る\n    </a>\n  </div>\n</div>"
